-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §127 (part לג): parts ט–יב apply to
-- non-academic young-division heads who are not first deputies.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `127`

@ref akn:art_127
GIVEN `a non-academic young-division head, not a first deputy` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `parts ט–יב apply to the head` `a non-academic young-division head, not a first deputy` IF
    `a non-academic young-division head, not a first deputy`
